@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
title View tutoring agreement balance

actor Tutor
participant API
participant "GetTutoringAgreementBalanceHandler" as Handler
database Database

Tutor -> API: GET /api/tutors/tutoring-agreements/{id}/balance
API -> Handler: GetTutoringAgreementBalanceQuery
Handler -> Database: resolve tutor
Database --> Handler: tutor
Handler -> Database: verify agreement ownership
Database --> Handler: owned agreement
Handler -> Database: aggregate active LessonCharges
Database --> Handler: TotalCharged
Handler -> Database: aggregate Payments
Database --> Handler: TotalPaid
Handler -> Handler: calculate Balance
Handler --> API: GetTutoringAgreementBalanceResponse
API --> Tutor: 200 OK
@enduml
